msgid "Categories and tags you create or import in Ukrainian or other non-Latin scripts are hard for search and suggestions built around Latin text to find. Budgie translates each name into English, adds search keywords, and keeps both forms. All of it happens on your phone, once On-device AI is on and its one-time download has finished."
