msgid "Refunds have the opposite problem: a merchant credit can look like income even though it reverses an earlier expense. Budgie consolidates clear refund matches automatically — including refunds in another currency that come back slightly larger than the original expense after conversion — and leaves uncertain cases exactly as they arrived."
