#: src/app/[lang]/blog/monobank-expense-tracking/page.tsx
msgid "Topping up a jar from your card shows up twice: once as money leaving the card and once as money arriving in the jar. Counted as is, that looks like a purchase you never made. Budgie finds such pairs between your own accounts and merges each one into a single transfer, which counts as neither spending nor income."
