#: src/app/[lang]/blog/track-money-you-lent-and-borrowed/page.tsx
msgid "You lent a friend money for a ticket, borrowed from your parents for a deposit, and a month later nobody remembers the exact amounts. This guide shows how to keep track of debts in Budgie: who owes you, whom you owe, how much has already come back, and what is still left."
